5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to see if our schedules are too fragile. I'll check the winter road closures north of the river and quoted delivery windows from suppliers.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm worried about who can actually get to us. I'll look into bus links in the two outer wards and attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I suspect the funding structure is the problem. I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment and running and equipment lines last year.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,We shouldn't repeat old mistakes. I'll review the two programmes begun six years ago and evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I'll check if we have the right people. I'll look at the volunteer register and supervision training and neighbourhood associations and tool certification.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
